<title>INDONESIA: GT Petrochem 1996 net at 54.02 bln rph.</title>
<headline>GT Petrochem 1996 net at 54.02 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   54.02 vs 60.07</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	140 vs 188</p>
<p>    Net sales			   256.74 vs 222.05</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 47.76 vs  70.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   35.69 vs  56.10</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     62.18 vs  78.93</p>
<p>Profit before minority interest 62.18 vs 75.55</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  139.67 vs 104.85</p>
<p>NOTE: PT GT Petrochem Industries, formerly PT Andayani Megah, is a tyre cord and industrial filament manufacturer. The firm is a member of conglomerate the Gadjah Tunggal Group.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
